$$
m \equiv 8 \pmod{11}
\Rightarrow m = 11n + 8
$$
Then:
$$
x = 12(11n + 8) + 8 = 132n + 104
$$
So $ x \equiv 104 \pmod{132} $

The possible values of $ x $ are:
$$
x = 104, 236, 368, \ldots
$$

The question says the emperor estimates about 200 soldiers, so the most likely value is:

$$
x = 236
$$

