We know that:

$$
1 \text{ minute} = 60 \text{ seconds}
$$

So, to convert 600 seconds to minutes:

$$
\text{Total time in minutes} = \frac{600 \text{ seconds}}{60 \text{ seconds/minute}} = 10 \text{ minutes}
$$

